---
// The emotional beat the current homepage never has: name the
// absence before explaining the competition.
---

<section id="absence" class="h2-sec h2-sec--ink">
  <div class="h2-wrap">
      <p class="h2-statement" data-lang-en="A country doesn't disappear from a competition. It stops entering." data-lang-fr="Un pays ne disparaît pas d'une compétition. Il cesse simplement de s'y inscrire.">A country doesn't disappear from a competition. It stops entering.</p>

      <div class="h2-body-copy">
        <p data-lang-en="Ten years is long enough that a generation of Canadian cooks has never seen the country on that floor. Long enough that being absent starts to feel like the normal state of things rather than a gap someone has to close." data-lang-fr="Dix ans, c'est assez long pour qu'une génération de cuisiniers canadiens n'ait jamais vu le pays sur ce parquet. Assez long pour que l'absence commence à sembler normale, plutôt qu'un vide que quelqu'un doit combler.">Ten years is long enough that a generation of Canadian cooks has never seen the country on that floor. Long enough that being absent starts to feel like the normal state of things rather than a gap someone has to close.</p>
        <p data-lang-en="Three chefs from <a href='https://www.bargeorge.ca/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>Bar George</a> in Montréal are closing it — not with a gesture, but with the years of preparation the Cup actually demands. Canada's entry for 2027 is theirs to cook." data-lang-fr="Trois chefs du <a href='https://www.bargeorge.ca/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>Bar George</a> à Montréal sont en train de le combler — pas par un geste symbolique, mais par les années de préparation que la Coupe exige réellement. La délégation canadienne de 2027, c'est la leur.">Three chefs from <a href="https://www.bargeorge.ca/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bar George</a> in Montréal are closing it — not with a gesture, but with the years of preparation the Cup actually demands. Canada's entry for 2027 is theirs to cook.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>
